'Offender at Large', 'Officious Interrogation', 'On the Job', 'Out Cold', 'Outrageous Robbery', 'Perimeter Enforcer', 'Person of Interest', 'Persuasive Interrogators', 'Pick Your Poison', 'Plains', 'Polygraph Orb', 'Pompous Gadabout', 'Presumed Dead', 'Private Eye', "Proft's Eidetic Memory", 'Projektor Inspector', 'Public Thoroughfare', 'Push // Pull', 'Pyrotechnic Performer', 'Rakdos, Patron of Chaos', 'Rakish Scoundrel', 'Raucous Theater', 'Reasonable Doubt', 'Reckless Detective', 'Red Herring', 'Reenact the Crime', 'Relive the Past', 'Repeat Offender', 'Repulsive Mutation', 'Riftburst Hellion', 'Rope', 'Rot Farm Mortipede', 'Rubblebelt Braggart', 'Rubblebelt Maverick', 'Rune-Brand Juggler', 'Sample Collector', 'Sanctuary Wall', 'Sanguine Savior', 'Sanitation Automaton', 'Scene of the Crime', 'Seasoned Consultant', 'Shadowy Backstreet', 'Shady Informant', 'Sharp-Eyed Rookie', 'Shock', 'Slice from the Shadows', 'Slime Against Humanity', 'Slimy Dualleech', 'Snarling Gorehound', 'Soul Enervation', 'Soul Search', 'Steamcore Scholar', 'Sudden Setback', 'Sumala Sentry', 'Surveillance Monitor', 'Suspicious Detonation', 'Swamp', 'Tenth District Hero', 'Teysa, Opulent Oligarch', 'The Chase Is On', 'The Pride of Hull Clade', 'They Went This Way', 'Thinking Cap', 'Thundering Falls', 'Tin Street Gossip', "Tolsimir, Midnight's Light", 'Tomik, Wielder of Law', 'Topiary Panther', 'Torch the Witness', 'Toxin Analysis', 'Treacherous Greed', 'Trostani, Three Whispers', 'Tunnel Tipster', 'Unauthorized Exit', 'Undercity Eliminator', 'Undercity Sewers', 'Undercover Crocodelf', 'Underground Mortuary', 'Undergrowth Recon', 'Unscrupulous Agent', 'Unyielding Gatekeeper', 'Urgent Necropsy', 'Vannifar, Evolved Enigma', 'Vein Ripper', 'Vengeful Creeper', 'Vengeful Tracker', 'Vitu-Ghazi Inspector', 'Voja, Jaws of the Conclave', "Warleader's Call", 'Wispdrinker Vampire', 'Wojek Investigator', "Worldsoul's Rage", 'Wrench', 'Yarus, Roar of the Old Gods']
